# API (Backend) npm Scripts Usage

- `npm run start`: Run backend in development mode with NestJS.
- `npm run start:dev`: Run with auto-reload on changes.
- `npm run start:prod`: Run production build (after build step).
- `npm run build`: Build project to `dist/` (TypeScript compile).
- `npm run test`: Run all unit tests (Jest).
- `npm run test:e2e`: Run end-to-end (e2e) tests.
- `npm run test:cov`: Run Jest coverage.
- `npm run lint`: Run and auto-fix ESLint over all api source files.
- `npm run format`: Run Prettier formatting on source and test files.

- Coverage, e2e config and test directories are used by Jest as per package.json/jest settings.
